---
// Two ways to keep the analytics store in sync with the checkout database:
//  1. dual write: the app writes to both; one write fails and the copies drift apart;
//  2. change data capture: the app writes once, a worker reads the commit log and
//     streams the changes to the column store.
// Plain inline SVG with site tokens; arrowheads are polygons, so no ids.

const W = 900;
const H = 392;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

// Row 1: dual write
const dwApp = { x: 20, y: 66, w: 150, h: 50 };
const dwPg = { x: 300, y: 44, w: 170, h: 40 };
const dwCh = { x: 300, y: 112, w: 170, h: 40 };
const toPg = arrow(dwApp.x + dwApp.w, dwApp.y + 18, dwPg.x, dwPg.y + dwPg.h / 2);
const toCh = arrow(dwApp.x + dwApp.w, dwApp.y + 32, dwCh.x, dwCh.y + dwCh.h / 2);

// Row 2: change data capture
const rowY = 272;
const boxH = 62;
const boxes = [
  { x: 20, w: 130, nameEn: 'Checkout app', nameVi: 'App thanh toán', subEn: 'writes the order', subVi: 'ghi đơn hàng' },
  { x: 186, w: 170, nameEn: 'PostgreSQL', nameVi: 'PostgreSQL', subEn: 'commit log (WAL)', subVi: 'nhật ký commit (WAL)', tagEn: 'system of record', tagVi: 'hệ thống gốc' },
  { x: 392, w: 140, nameEn: 'CDC worker', nameVi: 'Worker CDC', subEn: 'e.g. Debezium', subVi: 'ví dụ Debezium' },
  { x: 568, w: 140, nameEn: 'Kafka', nameVi: 'Kafka', subEn: 'change stream', subVi: 'dòng thay đổi' },
  { x: 744, w: 140, nameEn: 'ClickHouse', nameVi: 'ClickHouse', subEn: 'reports run here', subVi: 'nơi chạy báo cáo', tagEn: 'derived data', tagVi: 'dữ liệu phái sinh' },
];
const bracketY = 352;
---
<figure class="tocdc">
  <div class="tocdc-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: with dual write the checkout app writes to PostgreSQL and to ClickHouse; the ClickHouse write fails on a network error and the two stores disagree. Bottom: with change data capture the app writes only to PostgreSQL; a CDC worker reads the commit log and streams changes through Kafka into ClickHouse, where reports run.">
    {/* ---------- Row 1: dual write ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="24" class="tocdc-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Dual write: the app writes to both stores itself (avoid this)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Dual write: app tự ghi vào cả hai nơi (nên tránh)</tspan>
    </text>

    <g class="tocdc-box">
      <rect x={dwApp.x} y={dwApp.y} width={dwApp.w} height={dwApp.h} rx="8" />
      <text x={dwApp.x + dwApp.w / 2} y={dwApp.y + 30} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-name">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Checkout app</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>App thanh toán</tspan>
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class="tocdc-arrow"><path d={toPg.line} /><polygon points={toPg.head} /></g>
    <g class="tocdc-arrow is-broken"><path d={toCh.line} /><polygon points={toCh.head} /></g>
    <text x="226" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>✕ network error</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>✕ lỗi mạng</tspan>
    </text>

    <g class="tocdc-box">
      <rect x={dwPg.x} y={dwPg.y} width={dwPg.w} height={dwPg.h} rx="6" />
      <text x={dwPg.x + dwPg.w / 2} y={dwPg.y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-name">PostgreSQL</text>
    </g>
    <g class="tocdc-box is-off">
      <rect x={dwCh.x} y={dwCh.y} width={dwCh.w} height={dwCh.h} rx="6" />
      <text x={dwCh.x + dwCh.w / 2} y={dwCh.y + 25} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-name">ClickHouse</text>
    </g>

    <text x="500" y={dwPg.y + 25} class="tocdc-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>has order #1042</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>có đơn #1042</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="500" y={dwCh.y + 25} class="tocdc-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>never got order #1042</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>không bao giờ nhận được đơn #1042</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="300" y="188" class="tocdc-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The two stores now disagree, and nothing puts them back in line.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai nơi giờ lệch nhau, và không có gì tự kéo chúng khớp lại.</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* ---------- Row 2: change data capture ---------- */}
    <line x1="20" x2={W - 16} y1="208" y2="208" class="tocdc-rule" />
    <text x="20" y="236" class="tocdc-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Change data capture: the app writes once, the log feeds the rest</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Change data capture (CDC): app chỉ ghi một lần, phần còn lại đi theo log</tspan>
    </text>

    {boxes.map((b, i) => (
      <g>
        {b.tagEn && (
          <text x={b.x + b.w / 2} y={rowY - 8} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-tag">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{b.tagEn}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{b.tagVi}</tspan>
          </text>
        )}
        <g class="tocdc-box">
          <rect x={b.x} y={rowY} width={b.w} height={boxH} rx="8" />
          <text x={b.x + b.w / 2} y={rowY + 26} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-name">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{b.nameEn}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{b.nameVi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={b.x + b.w / 2} y={rowY + 46} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-small">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{b.subEn}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{b.subVi}</tspan>
          </text>
        </g>
        {i < boxes.length - 1 && (() => {
          const a = arrow(b.x + b.w, rowY + boxH / 2, boxes[i + 1].x, rowY + boxH / 2);
          return <g class="tocdc-arrow"><path d={a.line} /><polygon points={a.head} /></g>;
        })()}
      </g>
    ))}

    {/* Brackets under the two paths */}
    <path d={`M 20 ${bracketY - 6} V ${bracketY} H 356 V ${bracketY - 6}`} class="tocdc-bracket" />
    <text x="188" y={bracketY + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>checkout path: one write</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>luồng thanh toán: ghi một lần</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d={`M 392 ${bracketY - 6} V ${bracketY} H 884 V ${bracketY - 6}`} class="tocdc-bracket" />
    <text x="638" y={bracketY + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="tocdc-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>report path: runs in the background, off the checkout path</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>luồng báo cáo: chạy ngầm phía sau, không chen vào luồng thanh toán</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>With dual write, one failed write leaves the two stores out of sync for good. With CDC the app writes only to PostgreSQL, and every change reaches ClickHouse through the commit log, in order. Products named are common examples, not the only choice.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Với dual write, chỉ cần một lần ghi lỗi là hai nơi lệch nhau mãi. Với CDC, app chỉ ghi vào PostgreSQL, và mọi thay đổi tới ClickHouse qua nhật ký commit, đúng thứ tự. Các sản phẩm trong hình là ví dụ phổ biến, không phải lựa chọn duy nhất.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tocdc {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .tocdc-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .tocdc svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .tocdc text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-small {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-tag {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-note {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tocdc .tocdc-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .tocdc-box rect {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .tocdc-box.is-off rect {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 3;
  }
  .tocdc-arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .tocdc-arrow polygon {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tocdc-arrow.is-broken path {
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }
  .tocdc-arrow.is-broken polygon {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .tocdc-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .tocdc-bracket {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-faint);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .tocdc figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
